Package: twinforge
Version: @VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Depends: @DEPENDS@
Recommends: qt6-wayland, libarchive-tools, zstd, poppler-utils, ffmpeg, p7zip-full, rclone, git
Maintainer: Radu Nicula <radunicula@users.noreply.github.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/radunicula/twinforge
Description: Modern dual-panel orthodox file manager for Linux
 TwinForge (twinforge / tf) is a fast, native Linux dual-panel orthodox file
 manager built with C++20, Qt 6, QML, and libarchive. It features a
 non-blocking async engine, virtual archive browsing, live dark/light theming,
 workspace-linked saved searches, interrupted transfer recovery, and batch
 checksums.
